  "about": "Admin-tenant mirror of /api/website/pages for the Fulfillment cockpit (Web Design > Pages). Reads and writes the client's manual page list on the tenant row (tenants.website_pages, 0028) instead of GoHighLevel. Auth is enforced upstream (admin session only); do not re-check here. GET /api/admin/clients/:tenantId/website/pages -> { site: null, pages: [...], unavailable: false } PUT /api/admin/clients/:tenantId/website/pages body { pages: [{name,path}] } -> { ok: true, pages: [...] } (the sanitized, saved list) Body: PutBody { pages?: unknown; }"
